### 6 · Compare native experiments, then promote
Open `{{ dataset_name }}-demo` in Langfuse. Finish reserved-item curation with the
reviewed `NATIVE_EXPERIMENT_ITEMS.json` input and expected output first. Keep the
cohort unchanged and use identical model settings and dataset version for both runs.
Use **Experiments → Run experiment → via User Interface → Configure**, choose numeric prompt version
{{ prompt_versions.v1 }}, and explicitly select **policy_correctness**. Repeat with
version {{ prompt_versions.v2 }} and the same evaluator. A production rule alone
does not configure experiment scoring. Follow `POLICY_EVALUATION.md` to verify
