### 8 · Encore — hand the room the wheel
Put the **playground** on screen, or share the deployment's link outright. Anyone submits an
application against an **editable credit line** and gets the **real production decision** back, emitted as a live trace
at the top of the timeline. Hit **Dispute** with a comment (*"the €{{ '{:,}'.format(grant_amount_eur) }} EV grant should
