Open the trace in Langfuse to inspect the feedback; the Companion analytics snapshot stays unchanged.
If v2 was promoted in step 6, the eligible application already approves. To demonstrate the contrast again,
reset `production` to v1, submit and dispute, then promote v2 and resubmit the same eligible application.

